# Diagnostic: story flags after the opening (copy of the opening plan + a dump of the script context).
# Opening (feature opening-run, docs/re-opening.md): New Game, through the intro, then the wake-up call
# and the scripted run from Jian's room to the town map, with a shot and Jian's position every 40 frames.
